OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and mostly cloudy morning
OL,6,Fbut some bright or sunny intervals
OL,7,Fbreaking through. Cloud thickening in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon with the chance of some
OL,9,Flight rain. Southeasterly winds
OL,10,Fstrengthening through the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cloudy night with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof light rain possible. Heavy rain
OL,14,Fspreads east into western
OL,15,FAberdeenshire through the early hours.
OL,16,FBrisk southeasterly winds, perhaps
OL,17,Fstrong with risk of coastal gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
