OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,6,Fspreading eastwards and clearing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. This leaves a
OL,8,Flargely dry afternoon with long sunny
OL,9,Fspells developing. Strong winds
OL,10,Fgenerally easing through the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FMostly dry with sunny spells on
OL,14,FThursday. Cloudy and breezy start
OL,15,FFriday with rain clearing to bright
OL,16,Fspells and showers. Dry with sunny
OL,17,Fspells on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
